 r←Test_Notepad_002(stopFlag batchFlag);VTV;parms;n;cl;VTV2;⎕TRAP
⍝ Exercise the "Paste" functionality
 r←T._Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

⍝⍝⍝ Preconditions
 VTV←''
 VTV,←⊂'This is a simple integer scalar.'
 VTV,←⊂'A side effect of using ⎕WA is an internal reorganisation of the workspace.'
 VTV,←⊂'Any un-referenced memory is discarded.'
 VTV,←⊂'Numeric arrays are demoted to their tightest form.'
 VTV,←⊂'All remaining used memory blocks are copied to the low-address end of the workspace.'
 VTV,←⊂'Workspace above a small amount of working memory is returned to the Operating System.'

 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Notepad.CreateParms
 parms.posn←35 25
 parms.aplMode←1

 n←parms #.APLGUI.APLGUI.Notepad.Create VTV #.APLGUI.APLGUI.Notepad.CreateParms

 cl←⎕NEW⊂'Clipboard'

⍝⍝⍝ Tests
 n.Edit.SelText←(1 1)(1 1)
 cl.Text←'APL is great! '
 VTV2←VTV
 (0⊃VTV2)←'APL is great! ',(0⊃VTV2)
 ⎕DL 0.01
 #.APLGUI.APLGUI.Notepad.OnPaste n.∆Form ⍬
 →T.GoToTidyUp VTV2≢n.Edit.Text
 n.Edit.Text←VTV

 n.Edit.SelText←(1 1)(1,(1+⍴'This '))
 cl.Text←'APL is great! '
 VTV2←VTV
 (0⊃VTV2)←'APL is great! ',((⍴'This ')↓0⊃VTV2)
 ⎕DL 0.01
 #.APLGUI.APLGUI.Notepad.OnPaste n.∆Form ⍬
 →T.GoToTidyUp VTV2≢n.Edit.Text
 n.Edit.Text←VTV

 n.Edit.SelText←(1 1)(1 33)
 cl.Text←'APL is great! '
 VTV2←VTV
 (0⊃VTV2)←'APL is great! '
 ⎕DL 0.01
 #.APLGUI.APLGUI.Notepad.OnPaste n.∆Form ⍬
 →T.GoToTidyUp VTV2≢n.Edit.Text
 n.Edit.Text←VTV

 n.Edit.SelText←(1 6)(1 8)
 cl.Text←'⌹'
 VTV2←VTV
 (0⊃VTV2)←'This ⌹ a simple integer scalar.'
 ⎕DL 0.01
 #.APLGUI.APLGUI.Notepad.OnPaste n.∆Form ⍬
 →T.GoToTidyUp VTV2≢n.Edit.Text
 n.Edit.Text←VTV

 n.Edit.SelText←(1 6)(1 8)
 cl.Text←'IS'
 VTV2←VTV
 (0⊃VTV2)←'This IS a simple integer scalar.'
 ⎕DL 0.01
 #.APLGUI.APLGUI.Notepad.OnPaste n.∆Form ⍬
 →T.GoToTidyUp VTV2≢n.Edit.Text
 n.Edit.Text←VTV

 n.Edit.SelText←(1 5)(1 8)
 cl.Text←''
 VTV2←VTV
 (0⊃VTV2)←'This a simple integer scalar.'
 ⎕DL 0.01
 #.APLGUI.APLGUI.Notepad.OnPaste n.∆Form ⍬
 →T.GoToTidyUp VTV2≢n.Edit.Text
 n.Edit.Text←VTV

 n.Edit.SelText←(2 3)(3 2)
 cl.Text←''
 VTV2←VTV
 (1⊃VTV2)←'A ny un-referenced memory is discarded.'
 VTV2←(~(⍴VTV2)↑0 0 1)/VTV2
 ⎕DL 0.01
 #.APLGUI.APLGUI.Notepad.OnPaste n.∆Form ⍬
 →T.GoToTidyUp VTV2≢n.Edit.Text
 n.Edit.Text←VTV

 n.Edit.SelText←(2 3)(3 2)
 cl.Text←'ABC'
 VTV2←VTV
 (1⊃VTV2)←'A ABCny un-referenced memory is discarded.'
 VTV2←(~(⍴VTV2)↑0 0 1)/VTV2
 ⎕DL 0.01
 #.APLGUI.APLGUI.Notepad.OnPaste n.∆Form ⍬
 →T.GoToTidyUp VTV2≢n.Edit.Text
 n.Edit.Text←VTV

 n.Edit.SelText←(2 3)(3 2)
 cl.Text←'111' '22'
 VTV2←VTV
 VTV2[1 2]←'A 111' '22ny un-referenced memory is discarded.'
 ⎕DL 0.01
 #.APLGUI.APLGUI.Notepad.OnPaste n.∆Form ⍬
 →T.GoToTidyUp VTV2≢n.Edit.Text
 n.Edit.Text←VTV
 r←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
